## 5. API Routes

### Auth — `/api/auth`
| Method | Route | Description |
|--------|-------|-------------|
| POST | `/register` | Register new user |
| POST | `/login` | Login, returns JWT |
| POST | `/logout` | Invalidate token |
| GET | `/me` | Get current user |
| PUT | `/me` | Update profile |
| POST | `/refresh` | Refresh access token |

### Cats — `/api/cats`
| Method | Route | Description |
|--------|-------|-------------|
| POST | `/` | Report a cat (with photo upload) |
| GET | `/` | Get all cats (with filters: city, severity, status) |
| GET | `/:id` | Get cat detail + rescue timeline |
| PUT | `/:id` | Update cat info (volunteer/admin) |
| PUT | `/:id/status` | Update rescue status |
| GET | `/map/pins` | Get all cat coordinates for map |
| POST | `/:id/donate` | Donate to specific cat rescue |

### Missions — `/api/missions`
| Method | Route | Description |
|--------|-------|-------------|
| GET | `/` | List open missions (filter by type, city) |
| POST | `/` | Create mission (admin/volunteer) |
| PUT | `/:id/claim` | Claim a mission |
| PUT | `/:id/complete` | Mark complete + upload proof |
| GET | `/my` | My missions |

### Adoptions — `/api/adoptions`
| Method | Route | Description |
|--------|-------|-------------|
| POST | `/` | Submit adoption application |
| GET | `/` | List adoptable cats |
| GET | `/my` | My applications |
| PUT | `/:id/review` | Approve/reject (admin) |

### Volunteers — `/api/volunteers`
| Method | Route | Description |
|--------|-------|-------------|
| POST | `/register` | Register as volunteer |
| GET | `/` | List volunteers (admin) |
| GET | `/:id` | Volunteer profile |

### Donations — `/api/donations`
| Method | Route | Description |
|--------|-------|-------------|
| POST | `/create-order` | Create Razorpay order |
| POST | `/verify` | Verify payment signature |
| GET | `/my` | My donation history |

### Community — `/api/community`
| Method | Route | Description |
|--------|-------|-------------|
| GET | `/posts` | Get community feed |
| POST | `/posts` | Create post |
| PUT | `/posts/:id/like` | Like/unlike post |
| POST | `/posts/:id/comment` | Add comment |
| GET | `/stories` | Get success stories |

### Vets — `/api/vets`
| Method | Route | Description |
|--------|-------|-------------|
| GET | `/` | List vets (filter by city, cost) |
| POST | `/` | Add vet (user contributed) |
| GET | `/:id` | Vet detail |

### Fosters — `/api/fosters`
| Method | Route | Description |
|--------|-------|-------------|
| POST | `/register` | Register foster home |
| GET | `/available` | List available fosters |
| PUT | `/:id/assign` | Assign cat to foster (admin) |

### Marketplace — `/api/marketplace`
| Method | Route | Description |
|--------|-------|-------------|
| GET | `/products` | List products |
| GET | `/products/:id` | Product detail |
| POST | `/orders` | Place order |

### Notifications — `/api/notifications`
| Method | Route | Description |
|--------|-------|-------------|
| GET | `/` | Get my notifications |
| PUT | `/:id/read` | Mark as read |
| PUT | `/read-all` | Mark all as read |

