## 11. Deployment Notes (for demo)

- **Frontend:** Vercel (connect GitHub repo, set VITE_ env vars)
- **Backend:** Render.com free tier (set env vars, set start command: `node server/server.js`)
- **Database:** MongoDB Atlas free tier (M0 cluster)
- **File Storage:** Cloudinary free tier (25GB)
- **Maps:** OpenStreetMap — no API key needed
- **Payments:** Razorpay test mode — no real money

