## 12. Build Order (Recommended for 7 Days)

| Day | Focus |
|-----|-------|
| Day 1 | Project setup, auth (register/login/JWT), User model, basic layout + navbar |
| Day 2 | Cat model, Report a Cat page (with AI tagging), Cat Map (Leaflet) |
| Day 3 | Rescue Tracking (timeline), Missions (claim/complete), Socket.io setup |
| Day 4 | Adopt a Cat, Volunteer registration, Foster Network, Dashboard |
| Day 5 | Community feed, Success Stories, Vet Directory, Notifications |
| Day 6 | Donate (Razorpay), Marketplace, Profile page, Success Stories |
| Day 7 | Seed data, bug fixes, mobile responsiveness, demo prep |

